WEBVTT

00:00:09.591 --> 00:00:11.134
(CREATURES GRUNTING)

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:16.931
(GRUNTING STOPS)

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.481
(SCREECHING)

00:00:25.398 --> 00:00:26.441
What the--

00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:34.324
(JACOB SCREAMING)

00:00:34.491 --> 00:00:35.492
(RUMBLING)

00:00:37.827 --> 00:00:39.829
(SINGING) My momma, your momma

00:00:39.996 --> 00:00:41.414
Gonna catch a witch

00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:45.502
My momma, your momma
Flying on a switch

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.838
WITCHES LIVE AMONG US!
JOIN THE NEW SALEMERS ARMY!

00:00:49.005 --> 00:00:50.340
My momma, your momma
Witches never cry

00:00:50.548 --> 00:00:54.344
My momma, your momma
Witches gonna die

00:00:54.636 --> 00:00:58.473
Witch number one, drown in the river

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.227
Witch number two, got a noose to give her

00:01:11.986 --> 00:01:13.154
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:14.531
(RINGING)

00:01:17.325 --> 00:01:21.162
(SINGING) Witch number three,
gonna watch her burn

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:25.375
Witch number four, flogging take a turn

00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:33.883
Collect your leaflets
before you get food, children.

00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:51.693
Is it a witch's mark, ma'am?

00:01:56.155 --> 00:01:57.240
No.

00:01:58.074 --> 00:01:59.367
He's okay.

00:02:05.331 --> 00:02:07.250
(BUZZING)

00:02:10.587 --> 00:02:13.256
I can't believe
you didn't Obliviate that man.

00:02:14.173 --> 00:02:16.217
If there's an inquiry, I'm finished.

00:02:16.426 --> 00:02:17.760
Why would you be finished?
I'm the one that's--

00:02:17.927 --> 00:02:20.346
I'm not supposed
to go near the Second Salemers.

00:02:22.599 --> 00:02:23.600
(DOG BARKING)

00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:28.229
What was that?

00:02:29.564 --> 00:02:31.816
Uh, moth, I think. Big moth.

00:02:31.983 --> 00:02:32.984
(PEOPLE CLAMORING)

00:02:36.237 --> 00:02:38.281
POLICEMAN: Hey! Quiet down!
I'm trying to get a statement.

00:02:38.448 --> 00:02:40.700
HOUSEWIFE: I'm telling you,
it's a gas explosion again.

00:02:40.867 --> 00:02:43.286
I ain't taking
the kids back up there until it's safe.

00:02:43.453 --> 00:02:45.288
Hey, sorry, ma'am.
There ain't no smell of gas.

00:02:45.455 --> 00:02:47.123
It weren't gas, officer. I seen it.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:50.335
It was a gigantic, huge hippopoto--

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:52.128
Gas.

00:02:52.962 --> 00:02:54.589
Gas. It was gas!

00:02:54.756 --> 00:02:55.757
(ALL CLAMORING)

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:02.430
(BUZZING)

00:03:11.105 --> 00:03:12.523
(PEOPLE CHATTER)

00:03:16.319 --> 00:03:17.320
(GROANS)

00:03:20.073 --> 00:03:22.283
-(DOOR OPENING)
-TINA: Mr. Scamander!

00:03:44.305 --> 00:03:45.306
It was open?

00:03:46.015 --> 00:03:47.558
Just a smidge.

00:03:47.725 --> 00:03:49.394
That crazy Niffler thing's
on the loose again?

00:03:50.228 --> 00:03:51.437
-Uh... Might be.
-(JACOB GROANING)

00:03:52.939 --> 00:03:54.190
Then look for it.

00:03:54.399 --> 00:03:56.109
Look! Oh...

00:03:56.693 --> 00:03:57.860
His neck's bleeding.

00:03:58.403 --> 00:03:59.404
-He's hurt.
-(GROANS)

00:03:59.612 --> 00:04:02.115
Oh... Wake up! Mr. No-Maj.

00:04:05.368 --> 00:04:06.452
Mercy Lewis, what is that?

00:04:07.704 --> 00:04:08.830
NEWT: It's nothing to worry about.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.208
That is a Murtlap.

00:04:14.043 --> 00:04:15.211
What else have you got in there?

00:04:17.296 --> 00:04:19.424
-You?
-Hello.

00:04:19.966 --> 00:04:21.426
Easy, Mr...

00:04:21.592 --> 00:04:23.052
Kowalski. Jacob.

00:04:23.386 --> 00:04:25.221
You can't Obliviate him.

00:04:25.388 --> 00:04:26.389
We need him as a witness.

00:04:26.723 --> 00:04:28.474
I'm sorry. You've just yelled at me
the length of New York

00:04:28.641 --> 00:04:29.767
for not doing it in the first place.

00:04:29.934 --> 00:04:31.894
-He's hurt! He looks ill.
-He'll be fine.

00:04:32.061 --> 00:04:33.646
-Murtlap bites aren't serious.
-(JACOB GROANING)

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.696
Yeah, I admit that is a slightly more
severe reaction than I've seen.

00:04:42.238 --> 00:04:43.656
But if it was really serious, he'd have--

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.243
What?

00:04:48.578 --> 00:04:50.413
Well, the first symptom
would be flames out of his anus.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.873
-He doesn't seem to--
-This is balled up!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.249
It'll last 48 hours at the most.

00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:55.626
-I can keep him, if you want me to.
-Keep him? (SCOFFS)

00:04:56.044 --> 00:04:57.336
We don't keep them.

00:04:57.754 --> 00:05:02.175
Mr. Scamander, do you know anything
about the wizarding community in America?

00:05:02.675 --> 00:05:03.760
I do know a few things, actually.

00:05:03.926 --> 00:05:07.388
I know that you have rather backwards laws
about relations with Non-Magic people.

00:05:08.473 --> 00:05:09.599
That you're not meant to befriend them.

00:05:09.849 --> 00:05:11.517
That you can't marry them,
which seems mildly absurd to me.

00:05:11.684 --> 00:05:13.102
Who's gonna marry him?

00:05:14.187 --> 00:05:15.480
You're both coming with me.

00:05:15.646 --> 00:05:17.273
I don't see why I need to come with you.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.233
-Help me.
-I'm dreaming, right?

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:20.443
-Yeah.
-Please.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.987
JACOB: I'm tired.
I never went to the bank.

00:05:24.322 --> 00:05:26.074
This is all just
some big nightmare, right?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.992
For the both of us, Mr. Kowalski.

00:05:30.286 --> 00:05:31.287
(GLASS SHATTERS)

00:05:31.454 --> 00:05:32.455
(SNIFFING)

00:05:35.416 --> 00:05:36.459
(CREATURE CHITTERING)

